    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Birthday of Her Majesty The Queen, 1983 • HMY Britannia\nCATHAY PACIFIC AIRWAYS LID.\nSwire House, 8 Spring St., Sydney, Australia.\nVR-HDB - DC3\nFarewell Flight\nAUSTRALIA 1 9 SEP 1983\nVR-HOR\n/ 1 7 SEP 1983\nAustralia\n7870\n2000\nAUST.\nCATHAY PACIFIC AIRWAYS LTD.\nPublic Relations Department\nG.P.O. Box 1\nHong Kong\n27c\n18th-23rd September, 1983\nSydney-Cairns-Wewak-Davao-Manila-HongKong\nCATHAY PACIFIC\nThe Swire Group BH\nAIR MAIL",
      "2007.011.418\nVR-HDB is Cathay Pacific Airways first aircraft and was in service with the airline from its founding in 1946 until 1953.\nthe honging museum od Science and echoegy.\nThis farewell flight is undertaken prior to the DC3 being presented to the Hong Kong Museum of Science and Technology."
